<title>CANADA: Tarxien says Gecamex makes bid.</title>
<headline>Tarxien says Gecamex makes bid.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tarxien Corp said its board of directors will recommend that Tarxien shareholders accept a C$14.10 a share offer from Gecamex Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Gecamex agreed to make the all cash offer to Tarxien shareholders no later than October 31.</p>
<p>Tarxien said the offer will expire on November 21 and be subject to a number of conditions, including that at least 90 percent of the common shares of Tarxien are tendered.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
